["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/ExternalIdentifierType/isci", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "International Standard Collection Identifier (ISCI) is a variable-length identifier standardized by [ISO 27730](https://www.iso.org/standard/44293.html) for identifying collections held by libraries, archives, museums, and other memory institutions. It consists of two parts: the identifier for the assigning organization (an ISIL) enclosed in square brackets, followed by a local collection identifier string (e.g., `[FR-751041001]Casadesus1`).", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Dataset/DatasetPackage", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf", "https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Software/Package", "globalId", "", ""]
